 is willing to move the needle is so frustrating.</p>\n<p>While there are many things that I can complain about Trump, he is still doing more than any President in recent history to save our nation and ensure that we continue to be the strongest nation in the world.</p>\n<p>Between the Republican party (Thune) and the Supreme Court they have so undermined this President that it is hard not to believe that our country is severely compromised by enemies internal and external.</p>\n<p>The fact that congress has not gotten the Save America Act signed is proof enough.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 32, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2099591406801105268", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVHWBCsc", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 811, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8835272, "raw_content": "", "author": "PiratePatriotParrot", "created": 1789417891986, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Trump4Infinity", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVHWBCsc.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/nicksortor/status/2099591406801105268", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Capitol Police ENCIRCLE Mitch McConnell\u2019s house while he\u2019s still NOWHERE TO BE FOUND despite the Senate convening over an HOUR ago", "last_comment_created": 1789478262440, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is